    "body": "I have no clue why you require GPS for background uploads, but it drains my battery to empty.\r\n\r\nI see no reason for this behaviour and GPS is knonw to be the most heavy battery leaching process you can think off. All images are already GPS tagged by the iphone. Sooo no need to tag again, what also meens no need to calculate my position at all and no need to waste my battery!\r\n\r\nIf the phone is inside WLAN it need to upload the files - only than. WLAN on/off can be detected by the app without GPS.\r\n\r\nThe battery drain with this app is really extreme... ~800 images, 30% battery loss. I hope you can improve this and I hope it does not get empty before I'm back to a charger... :(",
